# 统一行尾为 LF：Windows 上编辑/打包产生的 CRLF 会让 Linux 侧的 bash 脚本直接语法错误
# （真机问题 #29：`deploy/install.sh: line 25: syntax error near unexpected token`）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制，禁止行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.mp4 binary
